  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Watercolor at Seaside!! <br><br>The Ward family's home away from no home in sunny WaterColor. <br><br>This 2800 sq ft 3 bedroom + bunk room / 4.5 bath home is located in Phase I of WaterColor directly behind Seaside and adjacent to the WaterColor tennis facility. It includes 3 large bedrooms with King size beds (plus daybed in Master), a bunk area that sleeps 6, teen lounge, spacious kitchen/great room on 1st floor, screened dining porch, and back porch. There are parking spaces for 2 cars in the driveway. One additional parking pass is available. <br><br>High speed internet service is provided free of charge. There are 5 TVs and a DVD player and DVDs. Enjoy close proximity to the beach, 4 pools (2 are heated) , BeachClub, restaurants including the Fish out of Water Restaurant and Sushi Bar, a wine market/cafe, tennis (including 5 Har-Tru courts-court fees apply), and boutiques. A Publix grocery store is located on-site. <br><br>OUR CALENDAR IS KEPT UP TO DATE. Posted rates include WaterColor Beach Club wristbands. Please note that wristbands are required for all guests age 5 or older. A maximum of 10 access bands are available. The number supplied is based on the number of people in your reservation. <br><br>No smoking or vaping and no pets.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "\"WayWard Sun\" in Watercolor just behind the Seaside Chapel! Steps to Seaside"
        }
      ],
